---
import AdminLayout from '../../layouts/AdminLayout.astro';
---
<AdminLayout title="Dashboard">
  <h1>Dashboard</h1>
  <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin-top: 1rem;">
    Welcome to the Portfolio CMS. Select a module from the sidebar to author content.
  </p>
  
  <div class="actions" style="margin-top: 3rem; padding: 2rem; background: #f9fafb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: var(--radius-lg);">
    <h3>CMS Architecture Active</h3>
    <p>This CMS natively enforces draft and published isolation. Draft changes made in the sidebar modules will not impact the live visitor portfolio until a trusted edge publishing mechanism is triggered.</p>
  </div>
</AdminLayout>
